    {
      "v": 4,
      "zh": "我要为耶和华―我　神的名建造殿宇，分别为圣献给他，在他面前焚烧美香，常摆陈设饼，每早晚、安息日、月朔，并耶和华―我们　神所定的节期献燔祭。这是以色列人永远的定例。",
      "en": "Look, I am ready to build a temple to honor[NOTE:1] the Lord my God and to dedicate it to him in order to burn fragrant incense before him, to set out the bread that is regularly displayed,[NOTE:2] and to offer burnt sacrifices each morning and evening, and on Sabbaths, new moon festivals, and at other times appointed by the Lord our God. This is something Israel must do on a permanent basis.[NOTE:3]",
      "notes": [
        "Heb “for the name of.”",
        "Heb “and the regular display.”",
        "Heb “permanently [is] this upon Israel.”"
      ],
