    {
      "v": 8,
      "zh": "又求你从黎巴嫩运些香柏木、松木、檀香木到我这里来，因我知道你的仆人善于砍伐黎巴嫩的树木。我的仆人也必与你的仆人同工。",
      "en": "Send me cedars, evergreens, and algum[NOTE:1] trees from Lebanon, for I know your servants are adept[NOTE:2] at cutting down trees in Lebanon. My servants will work with your servants",
      "notes": [
        "This is probably a variant name for almug trees; see 9:10-11 and the parallel passage in 1 Kgs 10:11-12; cf. NLT. One or the other probably arose through metathesis of letters.",
        "Heb “know.”"
